   <description>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">We provided a $2.6 million loan to GSEZ Mineral Port for the installation of a solar plus battery system at their site. The company is a dedicated mineral port in Gabon whose operations consist largely of the export of manganese ore.The loan will support their decarbonisation efforts through the installation of 1.56 MWp of solar PV and 1 MWh battery storage. The solar capacity will reduce dependence on more emissive grid energy and back-up diesel, while providing efficiency gains through operational savings.</narrative>
   </description>
